ined are kept below so the next reader does not re-derive this. This is a blank, not a deletion -- the chair may well be re-researchable, and that is an invitation.', ARRAY['https://malegislature.gov/Bills/192/H5001', 'https://malegislature.gov/Bills/192/S2924', 'https://malegislature.gov/Legislators/Profile/JJO1/Bills', 'https://malegislature.gov/RollCall/192/HouseRollCall200.pdf']::text[]),
